WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.235 --> 00:00:03.370
(jubilant dramatic orchestral music)

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.268
- I guess it is pretty green.

00:00:05.268 --> 00:00:06.601
To me, it's not.

00:00:09.761 --> 00:00:12.321
It wasn't just always all green.

00:00:12.321 --> 00:00:13.988
Now I'm quite green.

00:00:20.559 --> 00:00:23.847
My name is Elizabeth Sweetheart,

00:00:23.847 --> 00:00:25.847
and I am the green lady.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.997
(shuffling)

00:00:33.997 --> 00:00:35.662
Everything is green.

00:00:35.662 --> 00:00:39.829
I bought green counter,
and then I got green knobs,

00:00:40.747 --> 00:00:43.614
and then all the accessories.

00:00:43.614 --> 00:00:47.738
We even painted the front
door green. (laughing)

00:00:47.738 --> 00:00:50.722
If I find something that I really like

00:00:50.722 --> 00:00:54.889
in terms of clothing and
what I wear, I make it green.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.163
These are my overalls.

00:00:59.673 --> 00:01:03.006
I grew up with my family in Nova Scotia,

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:08.177
and they didn't know what
to do with me. (laughing)

00:01:09.655 --> 00:01:11.738
I wanted to be an artist.

00:01:13.118 --> 00:01:15.031
I started wearing green

00:01:15.031 --> 00:01:18.364
when my dad invited me to visit Florida.

00:01:19.596 --> 00:01:22.243
It was really exciting for me to go,

00:01:22.243 --> 00:01:24.751
because we hadn't really connected

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:28.918
and he didn't really care
for an artist. (laughing)

00:01:29.627 --> 00:01:33.210
The water is aqua-green,
deep, rich greens.

00:01:34.747 --> 00:01:36.941
I painted all the palm trees.

00:01:36.941 --> 00:01:40.276
And from that point on, I started adding

00:01:40.276 --> 00:01:43.574
little bits of green, because it was like

00:01:43.574 --> 00:01:47.074
a lucky day that dad asked me to go visit.

00:01:50.888 --> 00:01:53.805
It's been, I dunno, 17 to 20 years.

00:01:54.998 --> 00:01:58.673
I continue to wear green
because the way I dress

00:01:58.673 --> 00:02:02.678
makes other people smile
and say "Oh, the Green Lady!

00:02:02.678 --> 00:02:04.928
(laughing)

00:02:06.356 --> 00:02:08.939
"Can I have a selfie with you?"

00:02:10.529 --> 00:02:14.196
(jubilant orchestral music)

00:02:16.934 --> 00:02:19.751
I think people really, really like

00:02:19.751 --> 00:02:22.580
the belief that you like something

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:25.413
enough to really carry it through.

00:02:27.694 --> 00:02:31.441
When you're young, you tend to
think you look good in black.

00:02:31.441 --> 00:02:35.608
As you get older, you
realize color is so much fun!

00:02:36.363 --> 00:02:40.530
I will continue to be green,
'cause it's so positive.

00:02:41.176 --> 00:02:45.145
I think when it's not, then I'll change

00:02:45.145 --> 00:02:47.312
to my next favorite thing.

00:02:54.203 --> 00:02:56.620
(sonic ding)

